/** @page amqparchguide Architecture

    @tableofcontents

    The module uses a three-layer architecture:
    - \c amqp (binary module): C++ wrapper around \c qpid-proton-cpp providing @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpConnection
      and @ref Qore::Amqp::AmqpMessage
    - \c AmqpUtil (pure %Qore): High-level API with @ref Amqp::AmqpClient "AmqpClient",
      @ref Amqp::AmqpProducer "AmqpProducer", @ref Amqp::AmqpConsumer "AmqpConsumer",
      @ref Amqp::AmqpRequestReply "AmqpRequestReply", and
      @ref Amqp::AmqpManagementClient "AmqpManagementClient"
    - \c AmqpDataProvider (pure %Qore): Data provider integration with factory, connection scheme, and
      observable message events
*/
